WEBVTT

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:35.570
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.360
"The Dream that Dispersed in the Heartless Sky"

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.540
Hurry up, Tomo. We'll be late.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.080
Wait, Misao.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.620
What are you going to do if someone sees us?

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:00.940
Really.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:05.720
Now that people can see you, our neighbors think we're living together.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.320
What will they think if they find out you're a ghost?

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.890
Sorry, sorry.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.490
Old habits die hard.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:14.220
Just try to be a little more careful.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.760
Roger that.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:24.020
Run!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.080
Hey, wait.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.280
Don't fly!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.130
Sheesh.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.920
Misao!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.510
Good morning!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.290
Don't go running off on your own.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.060
Misao!

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:40.280
Good morning!

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:42.730
Looks like they took her from you.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:43.520
An.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.180
Jealous?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.580
Yeah, right.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.390
We'll be done hiding it by tomorrow.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.030
We're ahead of schedule.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.030
Did you light a fire under them?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:02.330
People don't need to know this is the second Earth.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.210
It will only fan the flames of anxiety.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.590
It won't help the world recover.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:14.690
Ruin guards.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:17.670
It's up ahead.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.400
What did you find, daddy?

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.060
Just tell me what it is.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.940
It's a surprise.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:25.660
Jerk.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:30.030
By the way, didn't I tell you to wear pants?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.220
I'll be fine.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.540
I'm not going to be excavating anything.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:38.840
Things like that happen here.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.600
I guess I should listen to my parents.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.440
Is that...?

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:52.460
Yes.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.430
It's the hope that will save this world...

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.330
...from the destruction that destroyed the first.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.950
I've never seen one before.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.640
I'm sure the Holy Guard will be happy.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.580
This will secure our continued funding.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.580
You have a lot of work ahead of you.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:14.480
Even though you came all this way, I won't have time for you.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.790
It's your job to examine the ruins left in this world.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:22.680
I'll grow up even without you there.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.450
Thank you.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.180
What?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:35.240
Yo.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.570
Let's go.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.130
We should leave them alone.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.580
You're right.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.210
What do you think, Haruna?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.610
If the ruin guards Castas Machina are still active...

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:54.640
...could there be something here other than that stabilizer?

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:59.320
Wouldn't you know more about ruins than me, Yo?

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:00.850
Not really.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.790
I didn't have much time to learn.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.510
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.450
Keep a low profile, Misao.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.600
What is that? Let me see.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:16.870
This is so cute.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.020
Are you lonely?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.200
I understand how she must feel.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.780
I was like that until I met you.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.820
It's nice to have friends.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.790
Help me, Tomo.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.770
Why don't you take some stuff out?

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.170
It'll fit.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.010
There.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.010
We're socialites.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.220
We're going to England for spring break.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.840
Your dad is just going there for work.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.490
I don't care. I'm going to brag about it to everyone once I'm in middle school.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.230
You might not want to.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.660
People won't like it.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.580
I was just kidding.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.580
Middle school will be fun.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.320
I hope I'll make a lot of friends.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:14.780
You're so reckless.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.790
It's easy to fix your limbs...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.770
...but your body is flesh and blood.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:22.220
You know how the strain you put on yourself personally.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.160
I need to move forward.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:25.840
Huh?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.050
I can't go back.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.270
Here.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.270
Your invitation to the preview.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.700
"King of Cherry Blossoms"

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.260
We finished the movie.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:40.290
What?

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.020
You're a terrible actress, Shuri.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.650
You got me.

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.140
But we look and sound exactly like each other.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:49.920
You're no fun.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.950
Is it true? About your movie, Yukari?

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:53.710
Yes.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.000
Congratulations.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.780
This is your first step.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:59.610
It's a very small step though.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:01.560
I'm looking forward to seeing it.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:04.670
I hope the critics like it.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.680
I'm sure they'll love you.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.120
Have some confidence.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.770
Yeah. We need this to succeed.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.000
Why?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:15.250
I'll have my sister work...

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.790
...and support me.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.700
You should do it, too.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.330
Don't be silly, Shuri.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.000
That doesn't sound too bad.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.030
What?

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:28.230
I'm sure it would be fun for the three of us to live together.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.970
I'll do my best.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.770
She's taking you seriously, Yo.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.890
Then I'll have you support me.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.190
What's wrong with you two?

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:55.650
By yourself?

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:01.310
Your princess is fluttering freely like a butterfly.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.700
Even after what you did to the stabilizer.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.230
She isn't free at all.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.760
She's trapped inside that machine.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.400
What is Kurogane to you?

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:11.220
Huh?

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:19.410
Uh, well, it was forced onto me...

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.440
Don't you think...

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:23.480
...there's a reason for everything?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.330
Daddy!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.600
Let's go, Yo!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.060
Daddy!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.300
Don't move until I tell you to.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.050
Over here!

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:54.410
Daddy!

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.370
Run, Yo!

00:08:58.510 --> 00:08:59.360
Daddy!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.560
Take the trunk!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:08.990
Daddy!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.830
Daddy!

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:18.650
You seem to think a burden has been placed on you...

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.480
...but it's important for you to accept and understand the truth.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.630
That's what I think.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.250
What reason is there...

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.240
...for Misao to be trapped in there?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.000
Thank you.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.010
I'm sorry about the stabilizer.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.700
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.700
I can't make that promise.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.940
You're hopeless.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.840
I'll try to keep it to something you can fix.

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.560
What's wrong, Yukari?

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.050
I'm so nervous.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.050
What, already?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.110
England is hours away.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.470
I'm just so anxious.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.000
Of course you are.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.660
You're an unknown actress that just debuted...

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.530
...called away to work for a foreign director.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.200
You could cancel.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.200
You're so mean, Shuri.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.990
Have some confidence.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.990
I'm sure you'll do fine.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.510
Shuri.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.510
I'll always be there for you.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:26.510
Thank you.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.890
Looks like I've uncovered an unfortunate past.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:43.950
Huh?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.580
You'll want tissues handy before you read this one.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.520
Tomoharu, we invited Misao to go karaoke with us...

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.050
...but you don't mind, right?

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:51.740
Huh?

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.600
I thought I should ask.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.890
Sure. What did Misao say?

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.160
She's excited to go.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.160
Oh. Sounds fine.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.490
I'll go, too.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:03.820
No boys allowed.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.000
"The dream that dispersed in the heartless sky."

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:14.650
"Trajedy strikes a rising young actress."

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.030
They were on that plane, too?

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.540
What are you sulking about, Misao?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.310
I get the window seat.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.160
Did I do something?

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.170
Yo?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.940
It is you!

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.940
What a coincidence.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:46.540
I thought you were treasure hunting with your father over spring break.

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.200
I'm running an errand for my father.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.160
An errand?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.160
I'm delivering this to his sponsors.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.810
By yourself?

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:54.910
That must be tough.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.910
You're not by yourself any more.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.140
Let's go sightseeing together in England.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.470
That sounds fun.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.250
I have some free time in my schedule.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.540
It would be great to see some of England.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:05.320
Right?

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:06.550
Sorry.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.940
I don't really have time for fun.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.610
I see.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.390
You do have an errand to run.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.250
Something didn't seem right with Yo.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.440
Maybe she's afraid of flying.

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:25.330
But she tried to look fine in front of us.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.650
I'm sure she's shaking now.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.150
Yeah, right.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.010
Don't worry, daddy.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.920
I'll make sure it gets there.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.030
Aren't those the chocolates I bought?

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:45.890
So?

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.650
It was going to be a gift.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:49.980
They don't need it.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.540
What are you so angry about?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.280
Those clothes...

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.730
It's my middle school uniform.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:00.810
I thought I would show my parents.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.610
You don't need to wear it on the plane.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.250
It looks great on you.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.040
Really?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:09.890
Yes.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.490
You were so slow to notice.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.020
Here. Open up.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:17.300
Aren't they good?

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:18.700
I know they are.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.710
I haven't seen my parents in over six months.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.200
I hope we'll be there soon.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:06.810
The trunk...

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.000
Where is it?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:14.630
Where is it?

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.090
Where is the trunk?

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:18.520
Where is it?

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:24.640
Where is it?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:36.620
I found it.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:39.460
I found it, daddy.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:57.010
Yukari.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:58.200
Yukari!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.130
I'm sorry, daddy.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:08.680
I won't be able to deliver it to the Holy Guard.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.800
But I can promise you this.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:12.410
I'll still be...

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.410
...responsible.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.410
Yukari.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.740
Can you hear my voice?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:46.590
This is not your place.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.010
Let's make a deal.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:00.070
Who are you?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.010
I represent Naotaka Natsume.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.470
I don't know you.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:08.510
We know you.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:41.460
Hey.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.240
Yo.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:51.430
Yo!

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:53.720
It's amazing.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.480
I can't believe you were able to recover.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:58.800
I'm so happy.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:00.580
I wanted to see you.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:01.710
So much.

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.570
Welcome home, Shuri.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:08.330
What are you talking about? I'm Yukari.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:12.390
You'll still a terrible actress, Shuri.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:13.760
Actress?

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.060
What do you mean?

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.320
You're still pretending?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.320
Don't you think it's a little much?

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:20.420
I can't believe you'd pretend to be Yukari.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.470
You shouldn't joke about it.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.950
All that laughing and crying must keep you busy.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.720
What are you trying to do, Shuri?

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.450
Stop calling me Shuri.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.120
Hey, what are you...

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:33.630
Why?

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:34.320
Huh?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.780
How could you let her...

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:39.920
You think the Dark Society could have saved her, too?

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:42.610
Don't you care, Yo?

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.050
You aren't seeing...

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:45.000
Answer me!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:45.860
I don't know.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:50.330
The Yo Susugihara you knew died in that accident.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.340
I was reborn with responsibility and purpose.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.170
You may not like it...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.160
...but I did everything I could.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:01.770
Shuri.

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:08.560
Yukari...

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.890
...disappeared after the accident.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.550
My name is Yukari.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:15.940
Why did Shuri...

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.180
...think she was her sister Yukari?

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:24.580
Are you doing better?

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.220
I can show you.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.100
I don't mind giving you a shot or two...

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.040
...to thank you for what you did to the stabilizer.

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:32.120
Wasn't the one that ruined it...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.340
...your Kurogane?

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.910
It's because you got in the way.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.250
Of course I did.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:41.750
We have to use the resources left from the first world wisely.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.830
I wish you wouldn't treat her like a tool.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:48.280
We've had this conversation before.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:55.690
Listen. I'm just letting you take care of her for now.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:57.360
Because I have to.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:18:59.100
But I'll take her back.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.610
Did you hear that?

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.510
Because I made you a burial doll...

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:09.280
...Shuri has grown to hate me.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.670
If I had the stabilizer...

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.400
...could I have spoken with you again?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:15.800
Yukari.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.190
What are you doing?

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.550
Oh, nothing.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.560
I thought I might do some cleaning.

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.910
Things are pretty tidy when Shuri isn't here.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.270
What about me?

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.010
Nice to see you.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.440
Are you okay?

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.010
Never been better.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.200
Thanks for asking.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:43.420
Where's Misao?

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:45.810
She went to karaoke with Higuchi.

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.370
So it's just the two of you?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.490
W-what?

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.300
I bet you two were getting it on.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.010
No, we weren't.

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:57.560
Yeah, right. What else would you two be doing together?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:19:59.880
Forget it.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.180
I'm going home.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:01.960
Fine.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:04.830
Um...

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.830
Oh, um...

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:09.540
Well...

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.000
You really are Shuri...

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:14.250
...right?

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.660
Of course I am.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.850
Nevermind that.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.360
We need to do something about Kanade.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:21.730
Huh?

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.010
G-getting it on...

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.000
Welcome back.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.600
You're late.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.000
Misao?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.460
Were you expecting someone else?

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.100
Nevermind.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.050
What happened to karaoke?

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:39.010
I canceled.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:39.560
What?

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.150
Come here.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:42.700
Huh?

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.000
Come on.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.290
What do you want?

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:49.870
W-what's wrong?

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.350
I feel most at home here.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.480
Here?

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.010
I guess it's part of being a ghost.

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:57.860
Huh?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:01.070
What are you doing?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.220
It's fine. No one's watching.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.510
Sure, but it's a little weird.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.850
Cut that out.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:16.540
Yo.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.320
We'll see it tonight.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.460
I can feel it.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:25.570
"Preview"

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:21.720
I want to see you.

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:22.640
I'm fine.

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:23.940
I can't be.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:24.860
I know.

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:26.860
Why? Because I believe.

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.000
I can't believe.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:28.780
Why?

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:30.050
Humans...

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:35.030
"The Youngest Daughter of the King of Misfortune"
